00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:35.370
people adopt to find out the truth and to
cut the risk of maybe signal boosting disinformation?

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:40.820
I mean, a great example is every couple of
days I read or someone writes to me, hey,

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:46.880
they're testing chloroquine as a possible
corona virus treat. And before I say that

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:52.720
to my audience, I want to figure out a type
of I doing the equivalent of spreading anti-vax

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:57.380
stuff or am I reporting on something that's
really going on? What's the right process

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:01.650
that you recommend people go through to figure
out what's what's real?

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:08.070
It's it's tough because the minute you report
on a lie, you've amplified the lie, and cognitive

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:12.560
scientists have shown that people will remember
the lie. They won't remember whether it was

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:16.910
true, they won't remember the source, but
just remember that they heard it. And so the

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:22.259
thing that's very important to do for anybody
