is a story because a prominent person said

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:33.949
it. I recommend that what people do is follow
the advice of the psychologist, George Lakoff,

00:05:33.949 --> 00:05:39.140
who said that what we need is a truth sandwich.
You start off by telling the truth. Then you

00:05:39.140 --> 00:05:44.889
report on the lie as a lie and then you fact
check it. You show why maybe the person was

00:05:44.889 --> 00:05:51.360
motivated to do it and what's wrong with it.
So it's very important for folks not to, as

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:56.870
